        "magnitude": null,
        "magnitude_source": null
      },
      "falsifier": "The antihistamine effect is not detectable if the difference in age at cirrhosis diagnosis between the highest and lowest antihistamine use quintiles is smaller than the smallest detectable effect (SDE) computed at the analytic sample size.",
